        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: \"Mr. & Mrs. Mxyzptlk\", Supergirl\n- Organizations: The CW, CBS\n- People: Ali Adler, Greg Berlanti, Andrew Kreisberg\n- Topics: television episodes, television series\n\nFacts:\n- Supergirl is an American superhero action-adventure television series developed by Ali Adler, Greg Berlanti, and Andrew Kreisberg, and it premiered on CBS on October 26, 2015.\n- Greg Berlanti and Andrew Kreisberg had previously created Arrow and The Flash before developing Supergirl.\n- \"Mr. & Mrs. Mxyzptlk\" is the thirteenth episode of Supergirl season two.\n- \"Mr. & Mrs. Mxyzptlk\" aired on The CW on February 20, 2017.",
